Hostile liches don't follow.  When it was tame, it followed because it was
tame.  Monsters with M2_STALK will follow you whether tame or not.  These
are:

* gremlins
* stalkers
* salamanders
* Croesus
* all 'i', 't', 'A', 'T', 'V', 'W', 'Z', ' ', and '&' (yes, the Riders have
  M2_STALK, but are rather hard to lure out of the Astral Plane)
* soldiers, sergeants, lieutenants, and captains
* watchmen and watch captains
* all Quest nemeses



